    "notes": "Captured absolute node locations from user-arranged Goalie clothing graph. ColorABC/ColorABC2 absolute from SK_Goalie_Shirt.001 (primary ~-2360, secondary ~-1790); TA ColorMask placer is TA_* only and must not move them. Unconnected ColorMaskSwatch/Pattern* RGB row only (never ColorABC) at 5_ColorMaskSwatch (-2618.32, 1287.78), step +280 X. Unconnected TA mask textures are packed at runtime into the left 2-col cluster (~-5441/-5132); connected masks keep ColorMask/Arc placers. No ColorTex / TextureArray_Colors. TA normals left of BaseColorOverlay; dual TA UV roles. BaseColorOverlay 1–5 absolute; 6–9 extrapolated (~-249.47 Y/step) — placer uses first Overlay N link (not socket-index Y). Decals internalized. Overlay Fac on Arc only. MI params at captured labels. TA image labels are Cotton skin; cross-skin placement uses role:TAMask:N / role:TANormal:N.",
